      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "These series are recorded in **app4** (`metrics.py` and the Flask hooks in `app.py`). Prometheus job is `manual-python`.\n\n- `traffic_volume` counts every request in `before_request`.\n- `http.server.request.duration` is request latency, in seconds.\n- `error_rate` counts responses with status 400 or higher.\n- `process.cpu.utilization` and `process.memory.usage` are sampled every 5 seconds at export time.\n\n**Route** filters the HTTP panels. Process panels cover the whole process. **Manual instrumentation — houses** is the trace dashboard and uses spanmetrics instead of these instruments.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Instruments recorded in app4",
      "type": "text"
    },
